{"slug":"622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru","title":"ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ - ಪ್ರವಾಸ ಶುರು!","titleEn":"Nanammal Matthu Kamalathal Pravaasa Shuru","level":"2","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":622209,"authors":["Menaka Raman"],"illustrators":["Sushant Ahire"],"translators":["Sudha Ramesh"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2024","donor":"the Sofina Covid Solidarity Fund","originalStory":{"title":"Nanammal and Kamalathal Travel by Road"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Nanammal Matthu Kamalathal - Pravaasa Shuru!’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. The development of this book has been supported by the Sofina Covid Solidarity Fund. www.prathambooks.org. This book was translated by an expert, as part of the voluntary translation drive happened during July-Aug, 2022","attributionLine":"ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ - ಪ್ರವಾಸ ಶುರು! (Kannada), translated by Sudha Ramesh, based on original story Nanammal and Kamalathal Travel by Road, written by Menaka Raman, illustrated by Sushant Ahire, supported by the Sofina Covid Solidarity Fund, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2024) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Two best friends","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":3,"title":"Things they do","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":4,"title":"Roadmap","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":5,"title":"Women walking","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"Woman cycling","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"Woman getting onto an auto","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"Women at the bus stand","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"Farmer passing on a bullock cart","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"On the way to the railway station","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"Reaching the railway station","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Bags and luggage","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":13,"title":"Two women on the train","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":14,"title":"Bird's eye view of station","illustrator":"Sushant Ahire","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ ಇಬ್ಬರ ಗೆಳತನ ಚೆಂದ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಯೋಗ ಕ್ಲಾಸ್ ನಡೆಸುತ್ತಾಳೆ.","ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ ಸಣ್ಣಂಗಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಇಡ್ಲಿ ಮಾರುತ್ತಾಳೆ.","ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್‌ಗೆ ಕುಂಗ್‌-ಫೂ ಚಿತ್ರಗಳಿದ್ರೆ ಮುಗೀತು.","ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್‌ಗೆ ಹಾಸ್ಯ ನಾಟಕಗಳಂದ್ರೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಇಷ್ಟ.","ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಎಲ್ಲಿಗೂ ತಡವಾಗಿ ಹೋದವಳೇ ಅಲ್ಲ.","ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್‌ಗೆ ಸಮಯಕ್ಕೆ ಬರುವುದು ಗೊತ್ತೇ ಇಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಆದರೆ, ಇಬ್ಬರಿಗೂ ಇಷ್ಟವಾಗುವ ಒಂದು ವಿಷಯ ಇದೆ. ಅದು —"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["— ಪ್ರವಾಸ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ ರಜೆ ಹಾಕುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾರೆ.","“ರೈಲು ಬೆಳಗ್ಗೆ 9.30ಕ್ಕೆಲ್ಲ ಹೊರಡುತ್ತೆ. ತಡ ಮಾಡ್ದೇ ಅಂದ್ರೆ ನೋಡು,” ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಈ ಸಲ ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್‌ಗೆ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ಕೊಟ್ಟಳು.","ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಬುತ್ತಿ ಕಟ್ಟಿಕೊಂಡು ತಯಾರಾಗಿ,","ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ ಮನೆಗೆ ಸೈಕಲ್‍ನಲ್ಲಿ ಹೋದಳು.","ಟಿಣ್ ಟಿಣ್... ಟಿಣಟಿಣಟಿಣ!"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪಂವ್sss ಪಾಂsssವ್!","ಇಬ್ಬರನ್ನೂ ಬಸ್‌ ಸ್ಟ್ಯಾಂಡ್‌ಗೆ ಬಿಡಲು ಆಟೋ ಬಂದಿತು.","ಅವರಿಬ್ಬರ ಇಷ್ಟೊಂದು ಲಗೇಜಿಗೆ ಆಟೋ ಸಾಲುತ್ತಾ?"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಯ್ಯೋ, ಈ ಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ಬಸ್‌ ತುಂಬೇ ಬಿಡ್ತು, ನಮಗೆ ಜಾಗವೇ ಇಲ್ಲ,” ಎಂದಳು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್.","“ರೈಲು ತಪ್ಪಿಯೇ ಹೋಗುತ್ತೆ ಈಗ. ನಿನ್ನಿಂದಲೇ ತಡವಾಗಿದ್ದು!” ಗೋಳಾಡಿದಳು ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಎತ್ತಿನ ಕೊರಳ ಗಂಟೆಯ ದನಿ ಗಲ್-ಗಲ್. ಗಲ್-ಗಲ್","ಅದೇ ದಾರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ರೈತ ಪಳನಿ ಚಕ್ಕಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂದ.","“ಕೇಳೇ ಇಲ್ಲಿ... ನನಗೊಂದು ಐಡಿಯಾ ಬಂತು,” ಕೂಗಿದಳು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಂತೂ ಇಂತೂ, ಇಬ್ಬರೂ ರೈಲ್ವೆ ಸ್ಟೇಷನ್‌ನತ್ತ ಹೊರಟರು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಫೀssss!","ಫೀssssssss!","ಅಯ್ಯೋ!","ರೈಲು ಇನ್ನೇನು ಹೊರಟೇ ಬಿಟ್ಟಿತು!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲಿಗೂ ತಡವಾಗಿ ಬಂದರಾ ಅಂತ ಇವರು?"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ವ್ಹಾ! ನಿಜಕ್ಕೂ ಇದೊಂದು ಸಾಹಸವೇ ಆಯ್ತು,” ಎಂದಳು ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್.","“ಇಷ್ಟೆಲ್ಲ ಸಾಹಸ ಮಾಡಿದರೂ, ನಾವಿನ್ನೂ ಗೋವಾ ಕೂಡ ತಲುಪಿಲ್ಲ!”","ಕಾಲೆಳೆದಳು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/622209-nanammal-matthu-kamalathal-pravaasa-shuru/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾಣಮ್ಮಾಳ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕಮಲಾತ್ತಾಳ್ ರೈಲ್ವೆ ಸ್ಟೇಷನ್‌ ತಲುಪಲು ಯಾವ ಯಾವುದರಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರಯಾಣಿಸಿದರು?"]}],"wordCount":167}